msgctxt "140"
msgid "Guh... Guess I'm no match for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Tell me, what's going on here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Geez! The moment my escort arrives, he leaves without\r\n"
"doing anything, then picks a fight with some random punk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Random punk? I thought you were his wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I don't know who the heck he is! I went out of my way to pay\r\n"
"some girl named Tomoko a lot of money for you! This sucks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "All right, you. Start talking. What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "It wasn't my idea! Someone put me up to this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"They told me to show up here, and I'd stumble into a couple\r\n"
"gettin' it on. Then I'd barge in, pretend to be her husband,\r\n"
"and threaten the guy for money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Who told you to do this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Some guy named Fumiyoshi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Fumiyoshi? You sure that was his name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I'm sure! He always hangs out at this bar named Shellac!\r\n"
"Go ask him yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"(Come to think of it, Tomoko's boyfriend was named\r\n"
"Fumiyoshi...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"(Those two have got to be up to something. I should head\r\n"
"over to Shellac and get them to spill the beans.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Hey! Hold on! You're not going to leave me hanging here,\r\n"
"are you!? Give me back my money, you swindler! Some escort\r\n"
"you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Hey, grandpa! What're you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Wait, aren't you the guy who was bothering Tomoko outside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "What? No, I'm this woman's husband! Who the hell are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"A girl named Tomoko told me to come up here, but this Aoi\r\n"
"girl's mistaken me for a male escort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"A male escort!? What's the difference!? You still tryin' to\r\n"
"mess with another man's girl!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Not at all. I haven't done anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Shut up! I'm not fallin' for your bullshit! You better\r\n"
"fork up some cash before I beat the shit out of you! 100,000\r\n"
"yen should do the trick!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Fine, I'll let you off the hook. Now get\r\n"
"the hell outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato <Color:8>1.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"What the hell? You're flat-out broke! You fuckin' with me,\r\n"
"old man!? I'll beat the shit outta you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Are you kidding me? Why would I pay a swindler like you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"You've got balls, old man! Guess I've got no choice but to\r\n"
"beat the snot outta you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "So, what's your name?"
msgstr "Allora, come ti chiami?"

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You're so dreamy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Why'd you get into this kind of work, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Wait, you know what I do for work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Yeah. Tomoko told me all about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "(I did tell Tomoko about it at the bar, but still, how?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "So, what led you to this line of work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Well... The man who raised me did the exact same thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I wanted to follow in his footsteps. That's why I started\r\n"
"down this path, to help those who didn't have anyone else\r\n"
"in their lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Hmm... I see. You know... I've been feeling pretty\r\n"
"lonely lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "You're alone too, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Huh. Well, if you need my help, I'll do what I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Hehe! I hope you'll \"help\" me a lot tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "So, how long have you been in this line of work, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "About two years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "And how many girls have you helped?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Girls, specifically?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"(There's Ayako and Riona, Eri and Izumi, and of course Haruka, so that "
"makes...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "...Five girls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Not too many, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Well, they're still just kids, so it's pretty tough making\r\n"
"sure they all get the attention they need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Wait, you take kids, too!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Of course. And not just girls. Boys, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Wow! Really!? That must be quite rough on you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Anyway... This room looks pretty expensive, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Haha! I figured, hey, it's a special occasion, so why not splurge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"Right... Well, I suppose this is your first time here.\r\n"
"That makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I was kind of nervous about this at first, but\r\n"
"I'm glad I worked up the courage to ask for her help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"I never imagined someone as dreamy as you would come walking\r\n"
"through that hotel room door, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Speaking of Tomoko, she sure is taking a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "What do you mean? We're just getting started..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "...Wait, what's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "Oh, come on, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

